{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6532e47b44e7b372b54f95b8dc0c1927d35b483a7447ba40f47c2530b6a96cab",
      "text": "Thanks for your hard work,\neverybody~. Have a lovely\nValentine's Fest~ ♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:63bf78ec2620ad59be5d4197f7011330b0b761fd72434874bd15adc6f48ce05b",
      "text": "What's wrong~...? Couldn't meet the\nperson you wanted~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9761a5c8bb9075926b9f5650dcae904a701efdabb90c977dec5403dff6f7b94e",
      "text": "N-no, I met her, but... Even in the\ndream I got nervous, and I couldn't\nconfess...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3f77b9de0c14a89ea0cc5f5a84bdcd9ef972784716d8e0b8cb3c5e8bcf874d75",
      "text": "Why can't I confess? Maybe I'm not\nseriously in love with her!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:805a7119dea62b2585f9926f4cc51b71fa09b900a4d4907695603f8817335a47",
      "text": "Huh...? U-um~? That's not true~...\num~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6a3972f78db6cd6fe1029f52edd2487990b3e2b5c8862b5a3b07493117d96b6c",
      "text": "I don't think so~... but~...\nLove... Liking someone is~...\num~... Hmmmm~...???",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "24": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:161deb77da5e42edc1e7b71e473751ff532734fbbdffa21b4d9954441c60474e",
      "text": "Sorry! I should deal with this\nmyself, right!? Excuse me...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "27": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:eb499d68a1424b0a0f9b77c0e48bc9930ddaa8f64e066ed0bc31848caf1cd693",
      "text": "Hmm~. Feanie wasn't helpful,\nmaybe~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "32": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3a15f1149b0b94d64f7416a12951d9c2f78e4224187e190e8b979cb5b6a07b6e",
      "text": "Yeah~... Feanie really has to study\nlove~...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "38": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1977b0a145cb2704031d588c1fa3b1c4922cd06d5abe9a8bd3a4da7c99e4aaa3",
      "text": "\"Win His Heart! Surefire Techniques\nfor Love's Games\"— Hmm hmm~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "41": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ec6fcc883a82d149cb512cbeda3f6edd849cecc9b4cf5356e34697784daadb42",
      "text": "\"Sometimes it's better not to say\n'I love you.'\" Why~? Don't you want\nto tell someone you like them~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "45": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4f54b4978b325c1aa1f755fcc8d623b070cdf024d7d8a499b88f8ce0e3cbbf3c",
      "text": "\"If you confess while diving off a\ncliff into the sea, you can't\nfail\"... this book says.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "50": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a13450298310f06c374314b7202a5be29c78116ebcfd55d764b6d87f652488bc",
      "text": "Eeek~, that's dangerous~! You'll\ndrown~!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "54": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:96517199f7d962500c9b74a89f9a2555e9ae159b0901eb26f967e198e706d253",
      "text": "Hwaa~. My head's sleepy again~...\nWhat is love, anyway~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:46877f6295972ea302cca7e9fb221b3f32306eac6d9f1efd8129f74d0120c131",
      "text": "Hmmm~... Is there anyone who\nknows~—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "61": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8bed0018664e6e61764859ce56b4c9c6e29ce9bae4ac534fe9eaf0daa98f78cb",
      "text": "...Mary is in love with Wilfred.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "65": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d1307e990d47dd470ed456e4d48177a9584eab652c6674eaaa2a7f0811751211",
      "text": "Maaary~...! Please be Feanie's love\nsenior~!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "70": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1aba49996585144c869f9bb278df08841093c5feab5d2ba211525e66c2f8cc62",
      "text": "Huh!? W-what do you mean!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "76": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:816e1325e1e7995c4819cd7e3aaa62b25c4b2a30185dd8fc04cf3b8b86201f67",
      "text": "You want to learn about love so you\ncan help everyone, huh...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "80": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3c70e4fa61d84f979100ecfd0730fb623bc2276bb320e293e7bda40fd237338",
      "text": "Yeah~. But it's kind of hard~...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "83": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c51b9a3d071a3602dbe25ab87f23473c7d9f1cf98c8fb75d2d9d88f23ae93f3d",
      "text": "Hey, Mary~. What is love, anyway~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "87": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8c27074c27192bacbd3b471a371cf9fdafd24925abad194d34878b767613e7c8",
      "text": "G-good question...? When I try to\nput it into words... Hmm...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "90": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2b7c41e3b832ef352132b6a439258f31cdae5c0fe0c118e9aca77ed814d17c05",
      "text": "Wanting to make someone special.\n...Maybe.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "94": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a0055658ef76792486faec7413e5c370eec0a3bc48959ce8722f5152651ec111",
      "text": "Special...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "98": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b1e83d935835fa2de0c03d43aedc37fe5ccbe0e102bb3cef955ce93968132514",
      "text": "I wanted the time I've spent with\nWill, and the time still to come, to\nbe the most special in the world.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "102": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:15e7810f7960f5803d8437decc463f7aaddde4ad5748cfb0eb6524862583ff7d",
      "text": "Wowie~... You really, really love\nWilfred, don't you~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "105": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e9ffa8103ea4b8beb1ef8ea6f58ecfd9cf13b2c52e15cb617ee54b7d6f534654",
      "text": "I see, I see~... The feeling of\nwanting to make someone special is\nlove—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "108": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a918552c733fceead6f7f5300942e6b48c2a670fd437e03b1dbe66311ea04ebe",
      "text": "...Huh? But Feanie... Mary and\nStella, everybody~ is special and\nFeanie loves them all, you know?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "111": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e1f825e7c35d1a814c793483d5122e411e70f91454f5c585bafe4c75f878e1d6",
      "text": "Is Feanie in love with everyone?\nBut there's no fluttery~ or\ngloomy~... Hmm~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:613823bcfb954ce624731e0e4000f682242a414cb0037d4c0aa12c7c3e14d307",
      "text": "Hmmm~...? Maybe Feanie can't be\nhelpful with love~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e1229a7785975d568287ab6e1507a93c6a60f7c91a67da7a01cda2fcb857f0fa",
      "text": "...Maybe it's okay not to\nunderstand?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "123": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:791d7ef67a64c33464f61a26345dc9821515e6eac293360fdfdc66b9e28a44c9",
      "text": "Huh...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "126": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:49746f11adbbd53a0ab605ffec81ebcfba3d6a5817e3f94a69efa78865b4f758",
      "text": "Understanding everything is probably\nimpossible. Don't you ever lose\ntrack of even your own feelings?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "130": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:01e119b85b0456b18466ec88dc16427e33b174bcef42b2fc76dd255ef0d26671",
      "text": "Ah... Yeah~. There were! It was so\nstrange and gloomy~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "134": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:128d0c557b0c489cda8620fd2fe2252d9992a195f3ae4d0782b26680860e05da",
      "text": "So you don't have to force yourself\nto understand, or try to answer\nsomeone's feelings a hundred percent.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "137": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3a774b27f32a618935ef9b6603f177ff1af2a9dcaa994bd2771606d2f9a69272",
      "text": "Actually, you're almost too kind,\nFeanie! It's okay to say \"that's a\npain,\" you know?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "141": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f1f7cda5f437d7a406ff857d6a906f37e6f1935aa4339ef4ea690395b7ee0422",
      "text": "Hwaaa~? I-I don't think I can~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:94eeb80e2477942940ba9aab37833757ec86887e71995951eed61a23f740048e",
      "text": "It's hard, and it makes me sleepy~.\nBut...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9b5c7678c699990f6b315a0f1229067986154eeeec9aea7b8a538c2d7dde1fee",
      "text": "...Feanie wants to understand. The\nshapes of love, and everyone's\nfeelings.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "151": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:918fbe2ff893b6f0f9cc94a3a9c83fe51581eb00f4e3d54ac838652be7c58319",
      "text": "Liking is free, and varied... and\nkind of squishy... Is love that way\ntoo?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "154": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ea487b4505e724dbedbb222bf1b08a300b8c8f95327af56db6680c346b83acee",
      "text": "...Is love like that, too?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "158": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a99df9540993f7f4494062774fd2dc5ec0d0e68b93921f89468a8e12b45b6bb5",
      "text": "...Aren't they all different?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "161": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8bddd47550ece2388cff0a35a606b70f21df39e0ddef9d937cf76702b530ed22",
      "text": "Because they're different... because\nthere are so many shapes. Maybe\nthat's why it gets confusing~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "165": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:910635306078acfb9bb1979d809acbb2b5920b096738064af197cbba30b306b4",
      "text": "Yes. Possibly.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "170": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:edb8508a06a6ed5e3255881d3c8794a1ec8797033c6f14f7e88fa6650a8ad1db",
      "text": "...Feanie thinks she understands a\nlittle now~...! Ehehe, yay~ ♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "175": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a98dc507b20f98319ac4bdb23e40a42ac0b3f7e2bddece8bec53b49f88cad22e",
      "text": "...Hehe. You really are lovely.\nBoth Feanie and Stella.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "178": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:df50cf4f72070309196215c34496d99906d4b5c7fc34a5427c9524413994d3cf",
      "text": "I'm still studying love too, I\nthink. ...I hope we can learn at\nour own pace, without rushing.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "183": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1bf1e00f40ce8f23dffab1e58c5869c7fccc05b07578ff76ad340dafa2987151",
      "text": "Yeah~! Thank you, Mary~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "187": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:de08c414459d077b3b5b429288e0342a8a4aee26c93ad39518844b7d929855d8",
      "text": "Hello~. How did the confession\ngo~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "190": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:50cffc9aee271fbb0d7a4fcc067c3cf3c082fe8ac1f739fef705a259f66a7adc",
      "text": "W-well, not yet... Ugh, I'm\npathetic.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "193": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e12b5c39c028f541d0e60baed95068cfc5d2313df6cd27376cc71e044a8e0878",
      "text": "Hey~. When you think about her, how\ndo you feel~...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "196": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c9a09f4891cbde06b2706669f55d1107ceb82e1bba239be7e94f496c6a7af1a0",
      "text": "How do I feel? ...Just thinking\nabout her makes my head blow up,\nand I don't know what to say—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ca90585e23d06a9d55d85e5777068040d268b75b40ecfa78d04f699705dc618d",
      "text": "\"I like her\" gets stuck in a huge\ntraffic jam in my chest!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "201": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3f95611bc5af1f68c8d64e91d7d403ba5ea2fa72456a615e5b3600b2330f8b33",
      "text": "I see~... That is your love, then~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7541ccded358007e376dc2cbe323ca4c2f67f1d3f998d6d9356f923a89979805",
      "text": "So let's practice one more time~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "208": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ca70a6b2bd4febc29e5d4f947deb25a978dbda0b3af0bdfecc231d4173d3320b",
      "text": "No need to rush, it's okay~. Let's\ndo our best at Feanie's pace~ ♪",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
